{"nodes": [{"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_centralized_model", "label": "Modelo CENTRALIZADO en la nube (VPS, producci\u00f3n real)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All branches live in one place with per-branch isolation at the user level; the design must survive several branches entering data concurrently, which is what forces queues and pub/sub."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_why_redis", "label": "Por qu\u00e9 Redis (bus de mensajes + backend de colas)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three things break under N concurrent branches: CSV import inside the request starves the Node event loop and Postgres connections; a table-polling delivery worker duplicates work once the API scales; and per-client SSE polling turns 50 viewers into ~17 queries/s. Redis converts heavy input into rate-limited queued jobs and live updates into pushed events."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_redis_lib", "label": "src/lib/redis.ts (connection + pub/sub duplicados)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "maxRetriesPerRequest:null is required by BullMQ, and pub/sub needs separate duplicated connections because a subscribed connection cannot issue normal commands."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_queues_lib", "label": "src/lib/queues.ts (import-csv, geo-import, db-restore, domicilios)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_import_csv_queue", "label": "Cola import-csv (POST /orders/bulk responde 202 + jobId)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The endpoint keeps the same branch scoping but only enqueues and answers immediately; the row-by-row work moves to the worker with bounded concurrency and retries, and the front follows progress over SSE."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_worker_service", "label": "Servicio worker (misma imagen, node dist/worker.js)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same image with a different command, so workers can be scaled independently of the API (docker compose up --scale worker=3)."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_import_core_refactor", "label": "Refactor a src/lib/importCore.ts (endpoint y worker comparten l\u00f3gica)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Extracting mapCsvRecords/resolveSeller/processOrderRecord out of routes/orders.ts avoids duplicating the import logic between the request path and the worker: behaviour is unchanged, only where it runs changes."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_redis_pubsub_sse", "label": "SSE de pedidos por Redis Pub/Sub (canal orders:new)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Replaces per-client 3s Postgres polling with push, and is the only way multiple API instances see each other's writes; the subscriber still filters by sucursalId so isolation is preserved."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_domicilios_queue", "label": "Cola domicilios (BullMQ, reemplaza el polling de SyncJob)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Producer enqueues on order creation instead of the worker polling; a limiter keeps the deliberate slow pace while adding real retries. No data migration needed \u2014 pending orders are re-enqueued by an initial sweep of orders without cost."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_geo_import_queue", "label": "Cola geo-import (consolidado de geolocalizaci\u00f3n)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_db_restore_queue", "label": "Cola db-restore (restaurar backup de otro server)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_redis_cache", "label": "Cache en Redis (pesos del warehouse y reportes pesados)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Short-TTL cache keyed by sucursalId+filters for reports (invalidated on import) and a 10-15 min shared cache of the weight map so every delivery worker does not re-download the catalog over the VPN."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_bounded_concurrency", "label": "Concurrencia acotada (IMPORT_CONCURRENCY, limiter de BullMQ)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ten simultaneous imports must not kill Postgres: N run and the rest wait in the queue, with the DB connection_limit (or PgBouncer) as a second safety belt."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_caddy_sse_passthrough", "label": "Reverse proxy sin buffering para SSE (flush_interval -1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A buffering proxy or short read timeout silently breaks the event stream; X-Accel-Buffering: no covers the nginx case."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_cutover_centralizado", "label": "Cutover a centralizado (consolidar hist\u00f3ricos sin perder datos)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One procovar_pedido database with a Sucursal row per branch; each local server's backup is restored with idempotent upserts so histories merge without duplicating orders, config.json stops pinning a branch (it comes from the user), and isolation is verified by logging in as users of two branches."}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_sucursal_isolation", "label": "Aislamiento por sucursal (usuario vs Super Admin)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_no_collapse_checklist", "label": "Checklist \"no colapsa\"", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_bundle_vs_future_yaml", "label": "Bundle real (sync-queue.mjs) vs upgrade futuro a BullMQ", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The shipped bundle runs the current DB-backed sync worker, while the `worker: node dist/worker.js` service in the inline YAML is the future BullMQ upgrade. Redis is already in the bundle so enabling it later needs no compose edit."}], "edges": [{"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_why_redis", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_centralized_model", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_why_redis", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_import_csv_queue", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_why_redis", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_redis_pubsub_sse", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_queues_lib", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_redis_lib", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_import_csv_queue", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_queues_lib", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_worker_service", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_import_csv_queue", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_worker_service", "target": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_import_core_refactor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/vps/DEPLOY-VPS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_vps_deploy_vps_import_core_refactor", 